{
  "id": "electrical_resistance_in_serial_and_parallel_netwo",
  "title": "Electrical Resistance in Serial and Parallel Networks",
  "description": "Calculate total resistance and current for resistors connected in series and parallel configurations, including individual currents through each resistor.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "content": "Parallel Resistor Network Calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "r1",
          "label": "R1",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "ohms",
          "defaultValue": 33
        },
        {
          "id": "r2",
          "label": "R2",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "ohms",
          "defaultValue": 33
        },
        {
          "id": "r3",
          "label": "R3",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "ohms",
          "defaultValue": 47
        },
        {
          "id": "r4",
          "label": "R4",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "ohms",
          "defaultValue": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "r5",
          "label": "R5",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "ohms",
          "defaultValue": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "voltage",
          "label": "Voltage",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "V",
          "defaultValue": 12
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "r_total",
          "label": "R (Total Resistance)",
          "unit": "ohms",
          "formula": "1 / (1/inputs.r1 + (inputs.r2 > 0 ? 1/inputs.r2 : 0) + (inputs.r3 > 0 ? 1/inputs.r3 : 0) + (inputs.r4 > 0 ? 1/inputs.r4 : 0) + (inputs.r5 > 0 ? 1/inputs.r5 : 0))",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "i_total",
          "label": "I (Total Current)",
          "unit": "amps",
          "formula": "inputs.voltage / (1 / (1/inputs.r1 + (inputs.r2 > 0 ? 1/inputs.r2 : 0) + (inputs.r3 > 0 ? 1/inputs.r3 : 0) + (inputs.r4 > 0 ? 1/inputs.r4 : 0) + (inputs.r5 > 0 ? 1/inputs.r5 : 0)))",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "i1",
          "label": "I1 (Current through R1)",
          "unit": "amps",
          "formula": "inputs.voltage / inputs.r1",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "i2",
          "label": "I2 (Current through R2)",
          "unit": "amps",
          "formula": "inputs.r2 > 0 ? inputs.voltage / inputs.r2 : 0",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "i3",
          "label": "I3 (Current through R3)",
          "unit": "amps",
          "formula": "inputs.r3 > 0 ? inputs.voltage / inputs.r3 : 0",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "i4",
          "label": "I4 (Current through R4)",
          "unit": "amps",
          "formula": "inputs.r4 > 0 ? inputs.voltage / inputs.r4 : 0",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "i5",
          "label": "I5 (Current through R5)",
          "unit": "amps",
          "formula": "inputs.r5 > 0 ? inputs.voltage / inputs.r5 : 0",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Series Connection Formula\n\n**R = R1 + R2 + ... + Rn**\n\nwhere R = total resistance (ohm, Ω)\n\n## Parallel Connection Formula\n\n**1 / R = 1 / R1 + 1 / R2 + ... + 1 / Rn**\n\nFor two resistors in parallel:\n**R = R1 × R2 / (R1 + R2)**\n\n## Current Calculation (Ohm's Law)\n\n**I = U / R**\n\nwhere I = current (amps), U = voltage (V), R = resistance (ohm, Ω)"
    }
  ]
}